<section class="bhd-page__feature"><div><p class="bhd-page__kicker">Before contacting us</p><h2>Start with the public investor pages</h2><p>The Investor Relations page explains the public company thesis and separates current assets from future development. Corporate Information provides public entity, product, research and intellectual-property reference points. Reading those first helps keep the initial conversation focused on the information that is not already public.</p><div><a class="bhd-page__button" href="/pages/investor-relations">Investor Relations</a> <a class="bhd-page__button bhd-page__button--secondary" href="/pages/corporate-information">Corporate Information</a></div></div></section>

<section class="bhd-page__cards-section"><p class="bhd-page__kicker">A useful first message</p><h2>Include four things</h2><div class="bhd-page__cards bhd-page__cards--4"><article><h3>1. Who</h3><p>Your name, firm or organization, role and website or professional context where relevant.</p></article><article><h3>2. Mandate</h3><p>Typical stage, geography, sector, cheque size or financing type, if applicable.</p></article><article><h3>3. Interest</h3><p>What specifically about Best Hydrate or the hydration category prompted the inquiry.</p></article><article><h3>4. Request</h3><p>The next step you are proposing: materials, introduction, meeting, diligence or financing discussion.</p></article></div></section>

<section class="bhd-page__prose-grid"><article class="bhd-page__prose"><p class="bhd-page__kicker">Confidential materials</p><h2>Some information belongs in diligence, not on the public website</h2><p>Depending on the relationship and stage of discussion, Best Hydrate may provide appropriate non-public corporate, financial or strategic information directly. Access to those materials is discretionary and may require confidentiality arrangements or other process steps.</p><p>Submitting an inquiry does not create an investment relationship, guarantee access to confidential information or constitute an offer of securities.</p></article><aside class="bhd-page__callout"><span class="bhd-page__callout-label">Privacy</span><h3>Share only what is needed for the first conversation.</h3><p>Do not send sensitive personal information or confidential third-party material through a general web form.</p></aside></section>

